[chant:0003 dedication-of-offerings]
[00:00.00]1 [Yo so] bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho
[00:12.89]2 Svākkhāto yena bhagavatā dhammo
[00:21.05]3 Supaṭipanno yassa bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[00:30.95]4 Tam-mayaṁ bhagavantaṁ sadhammaṁ sasaṅghaṁ
[00:39.26]5 Imehi sakkārehi yathārahaṁ āropitehi abhipūjayāma
[00:52.30]6 Sādhu no bhante bhagavā sucira-parinibbutopi
[01:02.05]7 Pacchimā-janatānukampa-mānasā
[01:08.71]8 Ime sakkāre duggata-paṇṇākāra-bhūte paṭiggaṇhātu
[01:21.20]9 Amhākaṁ dīgharattaṁ hitāya sukhāya
[01:29.36]10 Arahaṁ sammāsambuddho bhagavā
[01:37.02]11 Buddhaṁ bhagavantaṁ abhivādemi
[01:44.52]12 [Svākkhāto] bhagavatā dhammo
[01:54.67]13 Dhammaṁ namassāmi
[01:59.78]14 [Supaṭipanno] bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[02:10.50]15 Saṅghaṁ namāmi

[chant:0004 preliminary-homage]
[02:15.17]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhassa bhagavato pubbabhāga-namakāraṁ karomase
[02:26.21]2 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa
[02:38.22]2 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa
[02:49.54]2 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa

[chant:0005 homage-to-the-buddha]
[03:01.16]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhābhitthutiṁ karomase
[03:08.03]2 Yo so tathāgato arahaṁ sammāsambuddho
[03:18.79]3 Vijjācaraṇa-sampanno, sugato, lokavidū
[03:27.66]4 Anuttaro purisadamma-sārathi
[03:33.26]5 Satthā deva-manussānaṁ, buddho bhagavā.
[03:41.92]6 Yo imaṁ lokaṁ sadevakaṁ samārakaṁ sabrahmakaṁ
[03:51.09]7 Sassamaṇa-brāhmaṇiṁ pajaṁ sadeva-manussaṁ sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā pavedesi
[04:06.26]8 Yo dhammaṁ desesi ādi-kalyāṇaṁ majjhe-kalyāṇaṁ pariyosāna-kalyāṇaṁ
[04:21.37]9 Sātthaṁ sabyañjanaṁ kevala-paripuṇṇaṁ parisuddhaṁ brahma-cariyaṁ pakāsesi
[04:34.67]10 Tam-ahaṁ bhagavantaṁ abhipūjayāmi tam-ahaṁ bhagavantaṁ sirasā namāmi

[chant:0006 homage-to-the-dhamma]
[04:48.82]1 Handa mayaṁ dhammābhitthutiṁ karomase
[04:55.23]2 Yo so svākkhāto bhagavatā dhammo
[05:04.46]3 Sandiṭṭhiko, akāliko, ehipassiko, opanayiko
[05:13.81]4 Paccattaṁ veditabbo viññūhi
[05:20.78]5 Tam-ahaṁ dhammaṁ abhipūjayāmi tam-ahaṁ dhammaṁ sirasā namāmi

[chant:0007 homage-to-the-sangha]
[05:35.02]1 Handa mayaṁ saṅghābhitthutiṁ karomase
[05:41.02]2 Yo so supaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[05:51.37]3 Ujupaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[05:59.16]4 Ñāyapaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[06:07.20]5 Sāmīcipaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[06:16.34]6 Yadidaṁ cattāri purisayugāni aṭṭha purisapuggalā
[06:25.91]7 Esa bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[06:32.17]8 Āhuneyyo, pāhuneyyo, dakkhiṇeyyo, añjali-karaṇīyo
[06:43.06]9 Anuttaraṁ puññakkhettaṁ lokassa
[06:50.21]10 Tam-ahaṁ saṅghaṁ abhipūjayāmi tam-ahaṁ saṅghaṁ sirasā namāmi
[07:02.13]
